{"server":"tw","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st03","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_st03","title":"永別了，大地","storyCode":"EP-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"5db9a69886cbf9aa4a747e1f771189ef4da54c41e9057a1733491253c5244dc7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"跟隨哈維爾的船員們回到鎮子，跟隨胡安娜的船員們準備與棘刺一同出海，帕斯卡拉去尋找她的好生活，每個人都選擇了各自想要的未來。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"半個月後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩下這一艘完好的鹽船，其他的多多少少都有受損，但大部分構件和材料都能拆下來用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本是鹽船的設計圖紙，上面多多少少附帶了一點開船技巧。這張是鹽漠地圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，我都要！要是真的能從鹽漠裡走，商隊能省不少時間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你開個價吧，我們乾脆一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要這個數字，全用多布隆金幣結算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，你看看，金額對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！那我先走了，你們繼續忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人怎麼這麼爽快……哈維爾，我是不是要少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈維爾追上去兩步，順著繩子爬上了甲板。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個舵輪我留下了！多少錢？我退給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦，舵輪啊！這可是一艘船上最重要的東西呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要拿回去？那我要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，表情別這麼難看啊，老兄！剛剛交易已經完成了，它們現在是我的船了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公平交易嘛，看它在你心裡值不值得這個價格了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，那下次有機會再交易囉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——船員們！都過來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些就是剛剛賣鹽船得來的錢，我們平分，一人一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿了這筆錢，就去做你們自己想做的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，魯斯，你的份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，我還沒有想好我接下來要去做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做個決定，很簡單的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……之前，我想的是離開胡安娜，安穩一點。後來我覺得你也是個瘋子，跟著你也不會安穩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我站在這個鎮子裡，看著鎮上這些人，又瘦又乾，眼睛裡一點光都沒有……在這裡過日子真的安穩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不在這裡，去別的地方，以我那些海盜的本事，能過得上安穩的日子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說出來不怕你取笑，我其實蠻佩服蒂奇的。她比我大幾歲，一直都很有主見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我看到她傷成那樣，還是打定主意要跟著胡安娜出海……真倔強啊……也真夠厲害的，我可能就沒這個膽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……不說我了。你呢，哈維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該會換個地方開個餐館吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……就這樣吧，抽完這支菸，我也要上路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人嘛……誰又能知道呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鹽船逐漸遠去，哈維爾望著那白色的風帆和魯斯的背影一同消失在視線裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他把自己的那份錢收進口袋，朝著下一個路口，走遠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這個多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊的商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"一個銀幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊的商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"也是一個銀幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不貴嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個、這個和這個，都幫我包起來，放到我後面這輛車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊的商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！哎呦，您買這麼多東西，這是要去哪裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要就買了，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊的商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼啦，您看到什麼想要的直接和我說就好！我都包好了送到您的車上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，這還差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……買了衣服買了首飾還買了各種小東西……怎麼還是感覺少了點什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……少了點什麼呢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……對啊，你也很震驚吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）但我怎麼知道會這樣啊？天啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……嗯？他腰帶上的那個扣子真好看啊……亮晶晶的……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是什麼做的，金屬？寶石？……好想要……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好想要啊……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……那只不過是他們在路上偶然發現的東西，就挖出來帶上了，想說隨便賣點錢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）有人收嗎？真沒想到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒注意到我，馬上就能拿到了……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……誰能想到他們居然開了這個價錢……這個數字！你下半輩子都不用煩惱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）所以我們這次去也是做這個的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘿……到手！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）對……去哥倫比亞，我們賺筆大的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（賺筆大的？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉把手一鬆，扣子穩穩地回到了那人的腰帶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼賺筆大的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A&B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼偷聽別人說話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是別人，我可是不會這樣搭話的，但兩位老兄，看起來極為出眾，很不簡單啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才敢這樣冒昧上前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的路費，去哥倫比亞這麼遠，路上無聊，兩位老兄也跟我說說吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，我們真的要出海了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……居然真的會有這樣的一天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是的，小珍珠，我們是要出海了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真不敢相信……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜整理了一下被風吹亂的頭髮，望向身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，這下子我們真的一無所有了，但我打定主意想要出海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還願意和我們一起走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以當我的大副嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我的船長，準備好了……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我的老朋友在鬧脾氣了……讓我看看有什麼辦法能讓她消消氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個幾十年的老傳動核心，果然還是承受不住新裝的動力系統嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……溫蒂已經乘著她改造的小艇回去了，我們只好自己修修看了。船上還剩什麼材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，你的那個包包裡有什麼東西，怎麼這麼鼓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是極境之前塞給我的東西，但都沒什麼用，我都不知道到底是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先拿出來看看，說不定有用呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多打開自己的背包，裡面塞滿的東西一下子全掉了出來。\n胡安娜和蒂奇湊上前去，翻看了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？維生素片？這個是出海需要的東西啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊設備和防水靴也是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些工具……好像可以拿來修船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，極境這小夥子真可靠，這些東西現在可不好找啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩樣我先拿走了，應該能解決一下剛才的問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表情，你不知道這些事？這麼多東西，難道是我們分開的那天他給你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……那天我們沒有道別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前段時間，他隔一陣子就塞給我一個，我都放到背包裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，他早就看出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，比我自己還要早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的好兄弟還能看不出你的心思嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，問題解決了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"解決了？那我們可以出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呦呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出海——出海——出海——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，船長，該決定我們航行的方向了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多從胡安娜的手中接過望遠鏡。\n無垠的鹽漠上鹽粒隨風翻湧，像雪白的浪花，但他的視線飛快地掠過了這片虛假的海，投向極遠處的天邊，投向那一抹亮藍的棲所。\n他獨自一人站在了船頭，伸出自己的手臂，看著上面的光芒流轉，等待著它給出一個方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g14_ibtown_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"他站在街上，剛剛合起了手掌，夜空中最後一粒星光的碎屑也消散殆盡，黑暗再次籠罩下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"煙火結束了，我們走吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚喜的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧走吧，該回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼……"},{"type":"narration","text":"路人們紛紛散去，曾因他而聚集起來的人們，又離開了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜見他遲遲沒有反應，便大步上前，蒂奇也跟著踏上了艦艏的甲板。\n船員們一個接一個地湊上前去，想看看他們的新船長究竟看到了什麼。\n於是，伊西多的身邊圍滿了人，走在後面的船員不得不伸長脖子擠進人群中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，什麼？船長你到底在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是還沒有找到方向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"往哪裡開才是海？我們現在開的方向對嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多沒有回答他們的問題，他只是專注地看著自己的手臂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它怎麼一直在轉來轉去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它什麼時候才會指方向啊？哪裡才是我們要去的地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊……我們會去向哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，別急，我們的船長會告訴我們答案的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼現在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該去往的方向是哪裡呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿是在回答他的提問一般，他手臂上的流光不再毫無規律地遊走，而是筆直且堅定地向天邊漾起漣漪。\n他嚮往著和身邊這群夥伴一起開向那傳說中廣袤無垠的海洋，於是心相原質為他指出了大海的方向。\n船員們歡騰起來，蘭姆酒潑灑出來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡！是那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是大海！"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人的目光都聚集在伊西多的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下令吧，船長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"船員們的手中已經拿上了帆繩，胡安娜的手也放在了舵輪上，只等他一聲令下。\n伊西多深吸一口氣，回頭望向那些期盼他開口的真誠目光，他發自內心地感到，自己此刻不再害怕承擔起這份期盼。\n鹽漠上的風吹向他，他覺得如釋重負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船員們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拔起船錨，升起船帆——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們出海！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出海——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——呦——！♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i13"},{"type":"narration","text":"升起船帆嘿，收起船錨嘿♪\n讓狂風撕扯我們的衣衫♪\n讓暴雨澆醒我們的酒意♪\n準備！出發！港口的船有千千萬萬隻！♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亢奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要和海浪搏鬥！我要在風浪上航行！我要與雷電擊劍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要找到埋藏在深海的寶藏！閃閃發光的金幣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是……但是……我剛剛在想，我們現在因為想要一起出海才聚在了一起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"會不會未來有一天，我們有了不同的想法，就不會再在一起了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，未來？那也離現在太遠了，小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不論未來會怎麼樣，現在我們是在一起的，我們會一同出海！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別想那麼多，拉緊你手裡的帆索！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多船長，酒已經在手中，來說一句吧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多站上船頭，空氣中的水氣逐漸豐盈起來，他感受到了這種令人興奮的潮濕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬遠方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……哼哧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……哼哧……哼哧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼聲音？怎麼這麼熟悉……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……哼哧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾嘰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寶寶？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寶寶！你還活著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（狂舔胡安娜的臉頰）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來和我們一起出海的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地彈來彈去）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你真是我的好寶寶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道血痕從氤氲的蒸汽中延伸開來，蔓延到無邊無際的鹽漠深處。\n冰冷的舌頭品嚐著口腔中的血腥，殘缺的四肢由一股無主的強烈欲望驅使著向前挪動。\n不遠處，一條觸肢掙扎著破開鹽層，向著牠久違的日光蠕行。而後是第二條、第三條……\n另一股無主的強烈欲望驅使著暗淡的發光器官向太陽高高揚起，彷彿要從中借得光芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他只是想活下去，牠也只是想活下去。\n不擇手段，不擇形態。\n人的殘軀與海嗣的殘骸掙扎著，蠕動著，饑渴地互相吞噬。\n牠們將永生地行走大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
